OL,3,GNEWSAI won't accept exclusion within
OL,4,AGreen Party, says Polanski after
OL,5,Acriticism of Zionism motion
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe motion defines Zionism as an
OL,8,Fideology supporting "an
OL,9,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,10,Fbacks a "single democratic Palestinian
OL,11,Fstate in all of historic Palestine".
OL,13,FMore than a dozen Labour MPs reported
OL,14,Fthe Greens to the equality watchdog on
OL,15,FMonday, saying it raised "serious
OL,16,Fquestions".
